1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,435
Who was he just now?

2
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:04,515
The daytime shift at the
convenience store I work in.

3
00:00:04,971 --> 00:00:06,705
He's got quite a unique style.

4
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:10,377
How did you find me here?

5
00:00:10,377 --> 00:00:12,045
Hye-won told me.

6
00:00:12,178 --> 00:00:13,178
Why?

7
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:15,915
Here.

8
00:00:16,082 --> 00:00:18,852
Take it and
don't quit the job.

9
00:00:19,652 --> 00:00:20,920
I need you.

10
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,022
Is it because of the Reels?

11
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:23,323
No, not at all.

12
00:00:24,958 --> 00:00:26,092
I can't do this.

13
00:00:26,493 --> 00:00:29,129
Covering two jobs during
the weekdays is hard enough

14
00:00:29,129 --> 00:00:31,131
and I need to get ready to
pick up my studies again.

15
00:00:31,131 --> 00:00:32,131
And above all that...

16
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:34,479
I don't want
to embarrass myself.

17
00:00:39,272 --> 00:00:40,440
I can't take that money.

18
00:00:41,274 --> 00:00:43,343
If I do, I'll have to go back
to your shop again.

19
00:00:45,211 --> 00:00:46,413
And I can't do that.

20
00:00:48,148 --> 00:00:50,216
I can't leave
my post for too long.

21
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:52,536
So if you don't have anything
else to say, I'll be leaving.

22
00:00:58,124 --> 00:00:59,392
Do you want him back?

23
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:01,127
No matter what it costs?

24
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,501
But you know

25
00:01:09,135 --> 00:01:10,637
you don't have to do anything.

26
00:01:11,071 --> 00:01:12,439
Don't try to do something.

27
00:01:12,772 --> 00:01:15,275
Just tell him
how you truly feel.

28
00:01:15,642 --> 00:01:17,110
That's all it takes

29
00:01:17,610 --> 00:01:18,778
to reach someone's heart.

30
00:01:19,145 --> 00:01:20,580
There was no misunderstanding

31
00:01:21,114 --> 00:01:22,549
You were right.

32
00:01:22,882 --> 00:01:25,418
I'm the one that
got it wrong.

33
00:01:26,686 --> 00:01:27,686
I...

34
00:01:28,321 --> 00:01:29,489
I have feelings for you, too.
